        "popup_VMGetk": {
          "type": "popup",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Diamonds & Materials",
            "text": "<p>YAZ & Co works exclusively with lab-grown diamonds created in controlled environments using advanced technology. They share the same physical and chemical properties as natural diamonds, and their origin is always disclosed before purchase.</p><h4>Our selection standard</h4><ul><li><strong>Cut</strong> — Excellent, for optimal brilliance, proportion and balance</li><li><strong>Clarity</strong> — VS to VVS, where inclusions are not visible to the naked eye</li><li><strong>Colour</strong> — EF, a clean and refined white</li><li><strong>Light performance</strong> — assessed individually before a stone joins a collection</li></ul><p>All YAZ & Co jewellery is crafted in 18K gold and available in yellow, white and rose.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/faq-love-engagement\" title=\"faq-love-engagement\">Read the full diamond guide</a></p>",
            "text_2": "",
            "heading": "",
            "img_text": ""
          }
        },
        "popup_BWjahe": {
          "type": "popup",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Size & Fit",
            "text": "<p>Selecting the correct ring size helps ensure comfort, balance and security. You can find yours by measuring the internal diameter of a ring that already fits, or the circumference of your finger in millimetres. When your measurement falls between two sizes, choose the larger.</p><p>Selected designs are available in custom sizes on request. Complimentary sizing assistance is available at the boutique.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/size-guide-1\" title=\"Size Guide-new\">Open the full size chart</a></p>",
            "text_2": "",
            "heading": "",
            "img_text": ""
          }
        },
        "popup_pAxj44": {
          "type": "popup",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Made to Order & Delivery",
            "text": "<p>YAZ & Co does not hold ready-made stock. Every piece is crafted to your selected design, size, gold colour, diamond details and engraving after your order is confirmed.</p><p>Production:  <strong>15–20 business days from confirmed payment</strong><br/>UAE delivery: <strong>3–5 business days · 30 AED</strong><br/>International: <strong>7–10 business days · 200 AED </strong><br/>Courier: <strong>DHL or equivalent, fully tracked</strong></p><p>Timelines are estimates and may be affected by your location, courier delays, customs procedures and other circumstances beyond our control. For international orders, customs duties, taxes, clearance requirements and jewellery import regulations rest with the customer.</p>",
            "text_2": "",
            "heading": "",
            "img_text": ""
          }
        },
        "popup_W6zTHB": {
          "type": "popup",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Returns & Exchanges",
            "text": "<p>Returns are accepted within seven days of delivery where a manufacturing defect is proven, or the delivered item does not match the approved specifications. Any issue must be reported within 48 hours of receiving your order.</p><h4>The item must be</h4><ul><li>Unused and unworn, in its original condition</li><li>Returned with the original invoice</li><li>Returned with all packaging and certificates, where applicable</li></ul><p>Custom-made, made-to-order and engraved pieces cannot be returned, exchanged, cancelled or refunded once the final design and specifications are approved.</p>",
            "text_2": "",
            "heading": "",
            "img_text": ""
          }
        },
        "popup_Qxqh7X": {
          "type": "popup",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Authentication & Certification",
            "text": "<p>Every piece ships with its stone details, a unique serial number and full product information. An IGI certificate is included for diamonds above one carat.</p>",
            "text_2": "",
            "heading": "",
            "img_text": ""
          }
