        "popup_UHtzJG": {
          "type": "popup",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Care & Servicing",
            "text": "<p>Each YAZ & Co creation is made from refined and delicate materials. With thoughtful care, its brilliance is preserved over time.</p><ul><li>Keep your jewellery away from perfumes, cosmetics and harsh chemicals</li><li>Clean gently with a soft, clean cloth to maintain its shine</li><li>Store each piece separately in a soft pouch to prevent scratches</li><li>Remove before swimming, showering, contact with water or exercising</li></ul><p>Your maintenance service warranty covers professional servicing. It does not cover loss of stones, accidental damage, misuse, scratches, breakage, normal wear and tear, or work completed by a third party. Requests are subject to inspection by the YAZ & Co team.</p>",
            "text_2": "",
            "heading": "",
            "img_text": ""
          }
        },
        "popup_yX9T7z": {
          "type": "popup",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "label": " Shipping & Returns",
            "text": "<p>Orders are prepared within 25–30 business days.</p><p>UAE<strong>:</strong> 3–5 business days (AED 30)<br/>International<strong>:</strong> 7–10 business days (AED 150)</p><p> </p><p>Returns<strong>:</strong> Accepted within 7 days of delivery<br/><br/>(Items must be unworn and in original condition)</p><p> </p><p>Please note<strong>:</strong></p><ul><li>Custom pieces and earrings are non-returnable</li><li>Ring resizing is available within 7 days (additional fees may apply)</li></ul>",
            "text_2": "",
            "heading": "",
            "img_text": "<p>If you still have any questions, feel free to <a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"Customer Care\">contact us.</a></p>"
          }
        },
